# ANCHORED TO THE REPOSITORY ROOT, every one of them. An unanchored `vendor/`
# matches a directory of that name at ANY depth -- which quietly excluded
# `_sass/vendor/font-awesome`, the theme's own Font Awesome SCSS, and the first
# Pages build failed on `File to import not found: vendor/font-awesome/fontawesome`.
# The leading slash is what confines each pattern to the top level, where the
# things actually worth ignoring live.
/_site/
/.jekyll-cache/
/.jekyll-metadata
/.sass-cache/
/Gemfile.lock
/vendor/
/.bundle/
.DS_Store
